  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your paranoid suspicions about tyrannical thought police make you guard your speech.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Careful Speaker<sup>ISWG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You add your mythic tier on Bluff checks made to convey secret messages, and once per day you can use memory lapse<sup>APG</sup> as a spell like ability, using your Hit Dice as your caster level and your Charisma modifier to set the save DC. If you expend one use of your mythic power, you can use mythic memory lapse as a spell-like ability as an immediate action.</p>\n<p>When a non-mythic scrying, mind-reading, or alignment detection effect is used against you, you can roll twice and take the better result on your saving throw. If the effect does not normally allow a saving throw, you can expend one use of your mythic power to gain spell resistance of 11 plus your Hit Dice plus your mythic tier against the effect for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc49\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
